sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Worker
    participant CO as Coordinator
    participant R as Replica
    participant M as Memtable
    participant SST as SSTables
    W->>CO: Query partition
    CO->>R: Read partition from the front
    R->>M: Read current mutations
    M-->>R: Memtable cells
    R->>SST: Merge persisted cells
    SST-->>R: Ordered cells
    loop Visit cells
      R->>R: Skip tombstone
    end
    R-->>CO: First live row after 6 skips
    CO-->>W: task 7
